rticipates in the sixth step of the glycosylphosphatidylinositol-anchor biosynthesis. Probably acts by stabilizing the mannosyltransferase PIGM."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}